--   • members collects only the member references for that small relation set.
--   • wd_member_refs detects wikidata on just that tiny ID list using a fast
--     ILIKE string test rather than a full JSON FLATTEN across PLANET_FEATURES.
--   • Final aggregation joins members to wd_member_refs.

WITH q1095_bbox AS (  -- bounding box of multipolygon tagged Q1095
